ything on a fast start that seemed to unnerve the Australian. Would the Olympic final follow the same path? The answer was yes. Luo was never challenged after making a lightning start and only narrowly missed breaking Jones’ world record as she took the Olympic title."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The contest between two Australians for silver and bronze ended with a fingertip’s length victory for " [:a {:href "/athletes/103345"} "Brooke Hanson"] " with Jones narrowly relegated to third place.\nThis was the high point of Luo’s career as her career became increasingly hampered by a heart condition that led to her retirement from swimming in 2007."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/93362"} "Luo Xuejuan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} "1:09.07 (2 h5)"] [:td {} "1:08.57 (4 h1)"] [:td {} "1:06.64 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103345"} "Brooke Hanson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} "1:07.35 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "1:07.75 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "1:07.15 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/93269"} "Leisel Jones"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} "1:07.69 (1 h6)"] [:td {} "1:06.78 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "1:07.1